---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const gh = 'https://github.com/abhi-node';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Abhijith, a software engineer and Computer Engineering student at the University of
    Toronto. I mostly work on real-time systems and backend infrastructure.
  </p>
  <p>
    I started programming in fourth grade and got hooked through competitive programming. In
    middle and high school I taught intro computer science classes to other students.
  </p>
  <p>
    I just love programming, especially the parts that push you close to the machine or into
    the math: performance engineering, compilers, operating systems, computer architecture,
    machine learning, reinforcement learning and game theory. My favorite way to learn something
    is to build it from scratch.
  </p>

  <h2>Work</h2>
  <ul class="roles">
    <li>
      <span><strong>Crossover / Alpha School</strong> <span class="role">· Software Engineer (full-time co-op)</span></span>
      <time>Sep 2025 – Aug 2026</time>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span><strong>Gauntlet AI</strong> <span class="role">· Software Engineering Fellow</span></span>
      <time>Jun 2025 – Aug 2025</time>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span><strong>Beth Israel Deaconess Medical Center</strong> <span class="role">· Data Science Intern</span></span>
      <time>Jun 2024 – Aug 2024</time>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    At Alpha School I build real-time video and backend infrastructure, mostly Go, WebRTC and AWS.
    At Gauntlet I worked on voice agents and retrieval systems. At Beth Israel I worked on clinical
    research software and machine learning on sleep EEG data.
  </p>

  <h2>Things I've built</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/closed-code`}>closed-code</a>: an AI coding agent CLI in Rust with sandboxing and sub-agents</li>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/minidb`}>minidb</a>: a SQL database engine in C with a B+-tree and write-ahead log</li>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/gum-chess-engine`}>gum-chess-engine</a>: an alpha-beta chess engine in C, about 1700 Elo</li>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/sem-pdf-viewer`}>sem-pdf-viewer</a>: a semantic PDF reader with RAG chat over pgvector</li>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/dueled`}>dueled</a>: a 1v1 arena game with a from-scratch ray-casting renderer</li>
    <li><a href={`${gh}/audio-rtc-calling`}>audio-rtc-calling</a>: real-time audio calls on Go and Pion WebRTC</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={gh}>GitHub</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhijith-balagurusamy-46ab47248/">LinkedIn</a> · abhibalagurusamy@gmail.com
  </p>
</Base>
